# Battuta 1.
{x_bars: 1}
{x_cbg: CBG slide}
{x_drums: kick in quarti}
| G . . . |
{end_of_grid}

{start_of_verse: V1}
# Battute 2-9. Doc Drive: [1], prima parte.
{x_bars: 8}
{x_vox: lead vocal}
{x_cbg: CBG slide}
{x_drums: kick in quarti}
[G]l’Anguana me ciama
[G]l’Anguana me voe
[Bb]l’Anguana me varda
[G]l’Anguana me toe
[G]l’Anguana me sente
[G]l’Anguana me spia
[Bb]l’Anguana me vede
[G]e dopo ea va via
{end_of_verse}
{start_of_grid: shape="4x4"}
| G . . . | G . . . | Bb . . . | G . . . |
| G . . . | G . . . | Bb . . . | G . . . |
